    "name": "Hellbound: Reign of El Diablo",
    "steam_appid": 3702810,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702810/extras/51ab3e73dab1a26b6a7b9041416f0457.avif?t=1752633787\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Welcome to HELLBOUND! A black comedy crime game and comic book-inspired visual novel. A character-driven story set in the neon-stained slums of Baratrum City, CA, 2005.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years after the fall of his own crime syndicate, a half-demon named Zyne comes out of retirement for one last job, a heist meant to take down the city\u2019s biggest gang leaders. With his old reputation as El Diablo looming over him, Zyne swears this time it\u2019s on his terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But nothing ever goes to plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a crew of outcasts and monsters at his back \u2013 each with their own ghosts \u2013 Zyne leads high-stakes missions through a city built on sin and survival. As his past resurfaces and buried guilt claws its way forward, this &quot;final job&quot; becomes a reckoning. One that asks: can a man made of masks ever reveal what\u2019s real? And if he does\u2026 will anything be left of him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HELLBOUND is a dark, stylish tale of crime, identity, and chosen family \u2013 about queerness, anger, grief, and what it means to rebuild yourself when the world\u2019s already written your story for you. Sometimes funny, sometimes sad, always personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes over 100 original in-game backgrounds and illustrations, all drawn in ibisPaint X.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Disclaimer: HELLBOUND is a fictional work intended for mature audiences. It contains depictions of violence, substance use, addiction, and explores complex themes including trauma, identity, queerness, and masculinity.\u00a0All characters, artwork, and writing are created and owned by SodaFrizz.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3702810/extras/51ab3e73dab1a26b6a7b9041416f0457.avif?t=1752633787\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Welcome to HELLBOUND! A black comedy crime game and comic book-inspired visual novel. A character-driven story set in the neon-stained slums of Baratrum City, CA, 2005.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years after the fall of his own crime syndicate, a half-demon named Zyne comes out of retirement for one last job, a heist meant to take down the city\u2019s biggest gang leaders. With his old reputation as El Diablo looming over him, Zyne swears this time it\u2019s on his terms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But nothing ever goes to plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a crew of outcasts and monsters at his back \u2013 each with their own ghosts \u2013 Zyne leads high-stakes missions through a city built on sin and survival. As his past resurfaces and buried guilt claws its way forward, this &quot;final job&quot; becomes a reckoning. One that asks: can a man made of masks ever reveal what\u2019s real? And if he does\u2026 will anything be left of him?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HELLBOUND is a dark, stylish tale of crime, identity, and chosen family \u2013 about queerness, anger, grief, and what it means to rebuild yourself when the world\u2019s already written your story for you. Sometimes funny, sometimes sad, always personal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes over 100 original in-game backgrounds and illustrations, all drawn in ibisPaint X.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Disclaimer: HELLBOUND is a fictional work intended for mature audiences. It contains depictions of violence, substance use, addiction, and explores complex themes including trauma, identity, queerness, and masculinity.\u00a0All characters, artwork, and writing are created and owned by SodaFrizz.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "A demon-inspired crime story and visual novel centered around Zyne, the ex-mob boss, half-demon leader of a chaotic gang in 2005's neon-drenched Baratrum City. Battle inner demons, pull off heists, and confront a violent past in this gritty, story-rich tale.",
